{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29134","headline":"陪宣城大夫崔公泛後池兼北楼讌二首 二 · 许浑","name":"陪宣城大夫崔公泛後池兼北楼讌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上西来共鸟飞，翦荷浮泛似轻肥。\n王珣作簿公曾喜，刘表爲邦客尽依。\n云外轩窗通早景，风前箫鼓送残晖。\n宛陵行乐金陵住，遥对家山未忆归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}